        "jsCode": "// Fetch Tracked Competitors List returns an array of competitor objects\n// as a single item. Split each competitor into its own n8n item so\n// Trigger Agent Pipeline Run fires once PER competitor instead of only\n// once for the whole array (which previously hardcoded index [0]).\nconst competitors = $input.first().json;\nreturn competitors.map(c => ({ json: c }));"
