        "jsCode": "// Fetch Generated Reports returns an array of report objects as a single item.\n// Split each report into its own n8n item so Post Latest Report to Slack\n// fires once per report instead of only once for the whole array.\nconst reports = $input.first().json;\nreturn reports.map(report => ({ json: report }));"
